        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "My bad! There were some error in my config that messed with `User` augroup.\r\n```lua\r\nlocal grp = vim.api.nvim_create_augroup(\"User\", { clear = true })\r\n```\r\nI was using that group to my own `autocmd`s, changing `User` to something else fix the issue.\r\n\r\nI don't understand why it worked, but it is fixed now.\r\n\r\nThanks!",
